cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: "If you use SystS in your research, please cite the software."
type: software
title: "SystS"
authors:
  - family-names: "House"
    given-names: "Michael S."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-0282-2347"
repository-code: "https://github.com/IMAF-and-H-Consulting/Sysys_Release_v1"
abstract: >-
  SystS is a desktop application for systematic reviews and meta-analysis.
  It searches academic databases, screens studies, and links extracted claims
  and statistics to passages in the source papers. Researchers can inspect
  those passages, pool effect sizes, run robustness checks, and export
  review reports.
keywords:
  - systematic review
  - meta-analysis
  - evidence synthesis
  - literature screening
  - research software
